  <VWEFT_Bullet_HandheldGatlingGun.label>手持加特林机枪子弹</VWEFT_Bullet_HandheldGatlingGun.label>
  <!--EN: A heavy weapon meant as a portable turret, dismantled from its base and now carryable by strong individuals, power armor, or a powered exosuit. Despite this, the gun still requires hand cranking to reach maximum fire rate and now has a limited ammo supply.\n\nAs a last line of defense, many frontiersmen claim to land incredibly lucky shots with this weapon, swiftly turning enemies into fine red mist.-->
  <VWEFT_Gun_HandheldGatlingGun.description>从基座上拆下的重型武器，可当做移动炮塔使用。尽管如此，该枪仍然需要用手摇动才能达到最大射速，而且弹药有限。\n\n由于重量巨大，需要穿戴动力装甲或外骨骼才能有效使用。\n\n作为最后一道防线，许多拓荒者声称他们用这把武器打出过不可思议的幸运一击，将敌人射成了细密的红雾。</VWEFT_Gun_HandheldGatlingGun.description>
  <!--EN: handheld gatling gun-->
  <VWEFT_Gun_HandheldGatlingGun.label>手持加特林机枪</VWEFT_Gun_HandheldGatlingGun.label>
